      "title": {
        "en": "Patience with anxious and energetic pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents often highlight the gentle approach shown toward sensitive dogs and cats. Many note that nervous rescues, excitable puppies, and elderly pets remain settled during grooming, although two clients felt their pets were handled too casually or labelled aggressive."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Friendly team with occasional counter delays"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently commend groomers like Kay, Sophia, and Luh for their friendly guidance and welcoming manner. Most visitors report a reassuring reception, though isolated reviews mention feeling hurried during arrival or experiencing disputes regarding cancellation terms."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Neat styling and thorough de-matting"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviews regularly praise the standard of clipping, lion cuts for long-haired cats, and coat tidy-ups. Owners appreciate that pets leave looking neat and smelling fresh, while isolated feedback questioned whether teeth cleaning was performed thoroughly across all quadrants."
      }
    }
  ],
